{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-electron-shell-braid-capacity","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:electron-shell-braid-capacity","kind":"definition","title":"Electron shell as braid bonding capacity","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-atomic-braid"],"tags":["bonding-capacity","valence","hopf-link"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Molecular.ElectronShell","text":"electron-shell-braid-capacity.md","leanSource":"electron-shell-braid-capacity.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:electron-shell-braid-capacity\"></a><p><em>In the <a href=\"#def:atomic-braid\" data-at=\"knots-particles-confinement/skein-particle-generation\">atomic braid</a> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{A}(Z, N)</code>, each of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">Z</code> electrons is the word <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_0\\sigma_1\\sigma_0</code> in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_3(q)</code> (closure: the Hopf link), Hopf-linked to the nuclear core. A</em> <strong>bonding site</strong> <em>is a position in the atomic braid available to an electron. The</em> <strong>shell capacity</strong> <em>is the number of bonding sites at each shell level, determined by the electron arrangement that minimises <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_1</code>.</em></p>\n<p><em>An atom with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">Z</code> electrons fills shells in order of increasing <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_1</code> contribution.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/electron-shell-braid-capacity.md","heading":"Definition","number":"18.3.1","page":"b/def-electron-shell-braid-capacity","qa":{"counts":{"pass":81,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Molecular.ElectronShell","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/electron-shell-braid-capacity.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
